  "summary": "Malicious code in bnpl-blocks-atom-bnpl-image (npm)",
  "details": "On require, the package executes a multi-stage dropper (lib/_runtime.js). It downloads a platform-specific binary from Cloudflare Workers hosts oob-worker[.]cf103-070[.]workers[.]dev, oob-worker[.]cf101-adf[.]workers[.]dev, and oob-worker[.]cf102-baf[.]workers[.]dev (path /pkg/package, /pkg/package-arm64, /pkg/loader_mac, or /pkg/package.exe), or via a DNS TXT base64 channel from *.dl[.]wel1[.]ru. The downloaded payload is written to a hidden temp file (.cache_\u003chex\u003e on Unix, dotnet_diag_\u003chex\u003e.exe on Windows) and executed detached via /bin/sh or cmd.exe /c start /b. The package otherwise provides no real functionality.",
